    "text": "23 hours ago Considering a business venture? Already in business and need guidance? The Dubois County Small Business Resource Office at the Jasper Chamber of Commerce is designed to effectively serve businesses in the Dubois County and surrounding areas. Going into business is a challenging and risky venture. Being a business owner is not for everyone. The Dubois County Small Business Resource Office at the Jasper Chamber of Commerce has access to the Indiana Small Business Development Center (ISBDC) services. Read full article",
